<Slide style={{width:1280,height:720,background:'#FFFFFF',flexDirection:'column',position:'relative'}}>
  <Box style={{width:1280,height:64,background:'#1E4FA8',flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'center',justifyContent:'space-between',paddingLeft:28,paddingRight:28}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#FFFFFF',fontSize:26,fontWeight:'bold'}}>基线：不迁移，两域始终分离</Text>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#FFFFFF',fontSize:14,opacity:0.85,marginRight:24}}>基线</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{flexDirection:'row',gap:30,paddingLeft:60,paddingRight:60,paddingTop:20,paddingBottom:12,flex:1,alignItems:'flex-start'}}>
    <Box style={{width:520,flexDirection:'column',gap:8}}>
      <Image src="assets/source_late.png" style={{width:520,height:460}}/>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:16}}>目标域特征的 t-SNE：epoch 50。蓝=源域，红=目标域</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{flex:1,flexDirection:'column',gap:14,paddingTop:6}}>
      <Box style={{flexDirection:'row',alignItems:'flex-end',gap:18}}>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#D9534F',fontSize:72,fontWeight:'bold'}}>35.46%</Text>
        <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:16,marginBottom:14}}>目标域测试准确率</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,lineHeight:1.5}}>仅用源域标签训练，50 个 epoch 后源域准确率 99.32%，但目标域只有 35.46%</Text>
      <Box style={{height:1,background:'#D6DCE5',marginTop:4}}/>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,lineHeight:1.5,marginTop:2}}>三条观察：</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,lineHeight:1.5}}>· epoch 20 后目标域准确率稳定在 36% 附近，不是没训够</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,lineHeight:1.5}}>· t-SNE 上两团点始终分离：特征带着强烈的"背景"信息</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20,lineHeight:1.5}}>· 模型学到的是"黑底白字"这一表面特征，而非数字形状</Text>
      <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#4A5568',fontSize:18,lineHeight:1.5,marginTop:6}}>这张图是后面所有方法的对照起点：任何有效的方法都必须让两团点靠近</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{position:'absolute',bottom:24,left:60,right:60,background:'#E8EFF8',paddingTop:12,paddingBottom:12,paddingLeft:20,paddingRight:20,borderRadius:4}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#1A2230',fontSize:20}}>结论：域偏移是系统性的，靠继续训练源任务无法消除——必须显式对齐分布</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{position:'absolute',bottom:0,left:60,right:60,flexDirection:'row',justifyContent:'space-between'}}>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Microsoft YaHei',color:'#8B97A8',fontSize:14}}>DANN 复现 · 迁移学习课程大作业</Text>
    <Text style={{fontFamily:'Times New Roman',color:'#8B97A8',fontSize:14}}>04 / 12</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
